  "description": "How far would you go to convince your billionaire father that you deserve the keys to his kingdom? Smart, ambitious Seol would do just about anything, including hard labor on a farm for three months. Of course, it helps that her new boss, Bong-Su, is easy on the eyes. Will Seol prove to the hot farmer that she has what it takes? Will she win the respect of her family? Most importantly, how will she keep from falling in love with Bong-Su?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
